Frankenstein's Tomb
By Craig Dutton (c) 2017

You had escaped from your creator Viktor Frankenstein at last!

On escaping his castle you made your way to the city docks and stowed on board a ship heading towards the Polar Regions on a scientific expedition.  Alas, Viktor discovered you had stowed away and used his own ship to follow you.

Weeks later had passed and the expedition came to a woeful end.  The ship had frozen in the ice and the crew perished. You were the only survivor.

A frozen wastland lies before you and Viktor is not too far behind.  You can't run all your life so a final confrontation with your creator awaits you!

By the trapped ship
The frozen ship, dead in the cold waters of the north, looks pitiful. The silence deafens you in a way and the cold bites your skin. A desolate place indeed.
You can go east or to the deck of the ship.
