You can go by the trapped ship.
You can see some dead bodies.
> x dead bodies

The frozen dead bodies of the unfortunate crew. Some of their limbs are hanging by the sinews from the time you ripped them off in anger. They were trying to kill you! They didn't matter then and they don't matter now.
