In the crystal chamber
A round chamber with crystal walls, floor and a domed ceiling. A short black tube-like console stands to one side next to a pit in the centre of the room. On the wall opposite a wheel and a lever are seen next to each other. The most remarkable thing is the large red crystal rod hanging mysteriously without support centrally above the pit. You have no idea what this place was used for but it looks important.
You can go down.
You can see a console, a wheel, a lever, a rod, a dome and a pit.
> x console

A rounded black column situated on one side of the chamber.
It contains a red button, a yellow button, a green button and a blue button.
> look behind console

You find an open recess.
> put glowing crystal in recess

Done.
> turn wheel

You turn the wheel and the dome opens up letting in sunlight.
> pull lever

You pull the lever and the pit opens.
> push yellow button

You hear a loud ping. It's the correct button sequence.
> push green button

You hear a loud ping. It's the correct button sequence.
> push blue button

You hear a loud ping. It's the correct button sequence.
> push red button

You hear a loud ping. It's the correct button sequence and the rod starts pulsating giving off a strong glow. A beam of red light shoots down into the pit. The pit acts like a battery and charges up the city's power.
> push lever

You push the lever and the pit closes.
The rod stops glowing now the pit has closed.
> take glowing crystal

You pick it up.
> down

